{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is an action game based-on-stats without all the downtime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your sword and fight the Ronin! Protect the Emperor and still be done in time for work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/6494dab4f41441f31f68c467fb45763b.poster.avif?t=1751623189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/6494dab4f41441f31f68c467fb45763b.mp4?t=1751623189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Red River takes weapons, jewellry and modifiers and gives out build-focused gameplay with a good dose of hack&amp;slash. Grab your weapons and defend your clans honor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/c2c3df0a865e7fa6db08fb0bf6d43ef0.poster.avif?t=1751623189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/c2c3df0a865e7fa6db08fb0bf6d43ef0.webm?t=1751623189\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div><br>Will your gear endure all the carnage? Is your legendary Ninjato in top shape? Did you bring enough shurikens with you? The Empire depends on you. Will you see the sun rising, or will the sun see you setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/986eb923675546d40ddcf065bb7d3a97.poster.avif?t=1751623189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/986eb923675546d40ddcf065bb7d3a97.mp4?t=1751623189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1378790?t=1751623189","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1378790?t=1751623189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/03a1812c311436dd15686cd20b41cd60d1946c33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751623189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/03a1812c311436dd15686cd20b41cd60d1946c33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751623189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is an action game based-on-stats without all the downtime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your sword and fight the Ronin! Protect the Emperor and still be done in time for work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/6494dab4f41441f31f68c467fb45763b.poster.avif?t=1751623189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/6494dab4f41441f31f68c467fb45763b.mp4?t=1751623189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Red River takes weapons, jewellry and modifiers and gives out build-focused gameplay with a good dose of hack&amp;slash. Grab your weapons and defend your clans honor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/c2c3df0a865e7fa6db08fb0bf6d43ef0.poster.avif?t=1751623189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app